      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792439358947,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One codebase: no rewrite or port on export, so the installed app behaves like the one the user tested. React Native can't be compiled on the phone, so\nexport always uses a cloud build the user owns. In the exported app, capability modules map to normal Android permissions; Android's own app sandbox\nisolates it.",
      "originalText": "One codebase: no rewrite or port on export, so the installed app behaves like the one the user tested. React Native can't be compiled on the phone, so\nexport always uses a cloud build the user owns. In the exported app, capability modules map to normal Android permissions; Android's own app sandbox\nisolates it.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
